<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 108 0 R/T(Recruiting candidates- A search firm can help recruit candidates both locally and nationally through personal connections, established networks, and marketing outlets that your organization most likely does not have. This traditionally increases your candidate pool.)/E(Recruiting candidates- A search firm can help recruit candidates both locally and nationally through personal connections, established networks, and marketing outlets that your organization most likely does not have. This traditionally increases your candidate pool.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
