256 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 108 0 R/T(Time dedicated to the hiring process- The search process is time intensive in getting stakeholder feedback, recruiting candidates, making reference calls on each candidate, and preparing for the actual interviews.)/E(Time dedicated to the hiring process- The search process is time intensive in getting stakeholder feedback, recruiting candidates, making reference calls on each candidate, and preparing for the actual interviews.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]>>
