257 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 108 0 R/T(Objectivity in the hiring process- Your search team has a vested interest in your search process but is not invested in your organization and community like you are as a board member. Thus, the consultant can guide the process and ensure objectivity throughout the hiring process.)/E(Objectivity in the hiring process- Your search team has a vested interest in your search process but is not invested in your organization and community like you are as a board member. Thus, the consultant can guide the process and ensure objectivity throughout the hiring process.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[5]>>
