259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 108 0 R/T(Support with entry plan- The search firm can work with your successful candidate to tailor an entry plan so that they get off to a good start in your specific organization. Advice from stakeholders from the survey, financial and student achievement information, and data from the interview process shall all be considered in tailoring the entry plan and getting the new hire off to a successful start.)/E(Support with entry plan- The search firm can work with your successful candidate to tailor an entry plan so that they get off to a good start in your specific organization. Advice from stakeholders from the survey, financial and student achievement information, and data from the interview process shall all be considered in tailoring the entry plan and getting the new hire off to a successful start.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[7]>>
